{"id":"eb8ec521f1c6bc18","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md","title":"KF 正公式的统一去引号及固定点同值","display":"thm-T-schema-partial-recovery — KF 正公式的统一去引号及固定点同值","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery","aliases":["91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery","91-thm-T-schema-recovery","91-thm-partial-T-schema"],"display":"thm-T-schema-partial-recovery — KF 正公式的统一去引号及固定点同值","depends_on":["[[91-prop-positive-closure]]","[[91-prop-fixed-point-semantics]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery</span><span>91-thm-T-schema-recovery</span><span>91-thm-partial-T-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-T-schema-partial-recovery — KF 正公式的统一去引号及固定点同值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"938378420d182ce3\" href=\"?note=938378420d182ce3\" title=\"91-prop-positive-closure\">91-prop-positive-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8adbccc4211045f3\" href=\"?note=8adbccc4211045f3\" title=\"91-prop-fixed-point-semantics\">91-prop-fixed-point-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTm}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTm}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a> 的闭项编码域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x)\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x)\\)</span> 为正 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> 为原书版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 为任意真理语言句子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> 为闭项代入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 为取值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 为一致固定点评估。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recovery}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,\n[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))],\n\\qquad v_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recovery}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,\n[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))],\n\\qquad v_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项是 Lemma 15.4 的实际全正公式结果，第二项是语义透明性。原先 B、Ax_Comp、CompAdeq 没有给出足够确定的公理版本，故不能以其抽象条件承担恢复定理。\n两项范围不同，ψ 允许非正而有间隙，此时同值不使强 Kleene 双条件取指定真，也不使 KF 证明全语言经典透明性。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.4，印刷页 187；Lemma 15.13，印刷页 195，PDF 页 206。</p>\n","headings":[{"i